Cell["\<\
The results show that parallelization does not automatically lead to faster \
runtimes for small search ranges. This is because starting kernels, \
distributing definitions, and coordinating parallel tasks introduces \
additional overhead.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9909584169604397`*^9, 3.991655114107174*^9, 
  3.9916553541465225`*^9, 
  3.9916585416405563`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"548faee3-1bb2-e44e-bb30-\
