Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4 Summary of results", "Section",
 PageBreakAbove->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.694341537930465*^9, 3.694341550254487*^9}, {
   3.694342355079833*^9, 3.694342363410248*^9}, 3.6943428651189747`*^9, {
   3.6943430193857985`*^9, 3.694343019923829*^9}, {3.6943431695433865`*^9, 
   3.694343174763685*^9}, 3.6943456199998417`*^9, 3.92000525231802*^9, {
   3.991661437636198*^9, 3.991661437699058*^9}, {3.9916615272189217`*^9, 
   3.9916615286998367`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8ec61a4a-53fe-4595-983f-\
27013f567dad"],

Cell["\<\
This project investigated different algorithmic approaches for identifying \
narcissistic numbers in base 10.

The brute force approach is simple and transparent, but it becomes \
inefficient as the digit length increases.

The digit permutation class approach provides the main algorithmic \
improvement by avoiding redundant calculations.

Parallelization can further improve runtime, but only for sufficiently large \
workloads.

The best strategy is to group numbers by digit vectors, evaluate each digit \
composition once, and apply parallelization for larger workloads.
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6551323318137064`*^9, 3.655132346618133*^9}, {
   3.6558834788297663`*^9, 3.655883482105772*^9}, {3.655883581805547*^9, 
   3.655883589683561*^9}, {3.6558837346868153`*^9, 3.655883735919217*^9}, {
   3.694341574232729*^9, 3.694341596852769*^9}, {3.694342244717239*^9, 
   3.694342247462844*^9}, {3.694342333660995*^9, 3.694342343083412*^9}, {
   3.6943424202555304`*^9, 3.694342429299047*^9}, {3.6943424762647333`*^9, 
   3.694342484642213*^9}, {3.694342535512122*^9, 3.694342552269081*^9}, {
   3.6943425832578535`*^9, 3.694342597036641*^9}, {3.694342646046445*^9, 
   3.694342765915301*^9}, {3.694342880577859*^9, 3.694342892973568*^9}, {
   3.920005136849468*^9, 3.9200051373384686`*^9}, {3.991561967374443*^9, 
   3.991561971491989*^9}, 3.991655506319689*^9, {3.9916556344291267`*^9, 
   3.9916556427035885`*^9}, {3.9916587650447865`*^9, 
   3.991658765484169*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a12306db-f2be-514e-b589-\
fc8674c19ad9"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
},
